===Etymology===
From {{etyl|gmh|de}} {{term|volgen|lang=gmh}}, from {{etyl|goh|de}} {{term|folgen|folgēn|lang=goh}}, from {{etyl|gem-pro|de}} {{recons|fulgijaną|lang=gem-pro}}. Compare Dutch {{term|volgen|lang=nl}}, English {{term|follow|lang=en}}, Danish {{term|følge|lang=da}}, Swedish {{term|följa|lang=sv}}.

===Pronunciation===
* {{IPA|/ˈfɔlɡŋ̩/|/ˈfɔlɡən/|lang=de}}
* {{audio|De-folgen.ogg|audio}}

